[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1140.394, "timestamp": "00:19:00", "text": "嗯，我说过我要退步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1144.515, "timestamp": "00:19:04", "text": "是的，来回折腾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1149.589, "timestamp": "00:19:09", "text": "不，我只是在倒退。并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1151.714, "timestamp": "00:19:11", "text": "向前，只向后 。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1157.969, "timestamp": "00:19:17", "text": "只有倒退才能做到。如果我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1158.957, "timestamp": "00:19:18", "text": "移动一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1163.01, "timestamp": "00:19:23", "text": "是的，我以前从未见过这样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1165.788, "timestamp": "00:19:25", "text": "我一生都是如此。你知道，没有一个方程式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1167.373, "timestamp": "00:19:27", "text": "数学可以解决这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1171.045, "timestamp": "00:19:31", "text": "是的，我想我需要把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1175.76, "timestamp": "00:19:35", "text": "倒计时结束。我们可以看到什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1178.097, "timestamp": "00:19:38", "text": "我们落后太多了，各种延误等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1183.392, "timestamp": "00:19:43", "text": "那。我认为这次延误意义重大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1185.316, "timestamp": "00:19:45", "text": "因为我刚才看到我的头像出现了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1190.081, "timestamp": "00:19:50", "text": "是的，有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1191.369, "timestamp": "00:19:51", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1195.284, "timestamp": "00:19:55", "text": "是的，这种情况发生时确实有点烦人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1199.28, "timestamp": "00:19:59", "text": "所以。是的，事实就是这样。"}]